    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude80 Space Revolver</strong><br><strong>A Strategic Puzzle Adventure Utilizing Gravity and Map Rotation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Space Revolver</i> is a strategic puzzle game set aboard a space station. Players take on the role of a trainee who must solve increasingly complex puzzles using simple controls. By rotating the map and toggling gravity, players must navigate through challenging environments that test both creativity and logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd11</strong> <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Gravity Manipulation &amp; Map Rotation</strong>: Redefine spatial awareness by altering gravity and rotating the environment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/f50af957e282603af8be8387eb14e289.poster.avif?t=1755073869\" width=286 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/f50af957e282603af8be8387eb14e289.webm?t=1755073869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/f50af957e282603af8be8387eb14e289.mp4?t=1755073869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Evolving Puzzle Design</strong>: Start with intuitive challenges that gradually require logical deduction and strategic planning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Five Core Controls</strong>: Move left/right, rotate the map left/right, and toggle gravity on/off to find optimal solutions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Retro Pixel Art with Sci-Fi Aesthetics</strong>: Experience a unique visual style combining classic pixel art with futuristic effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Gameplay Overview</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic Controls</strong>: Left/Right Movement, Map Rotation (Left/Right), Gravity Toggle (On/Off)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Obstacles &amp; Mechanics</strong>: Lasers, spikes, electric blocks, switches, movable boxes, ON/OFF blocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playstyle</strong>: Limited moves encourage efficient problem-solving and multiple solution paths, embodying the &quot;Easy to Learn, Hard to Master&quot; philosophy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udccc Development Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originating from Krafton's Jungle Game Lab, <i>Space Revolver</i> evolved from a game jam concept into a commercial title through extensive feedback and iteration. Developed by a dedicated two-person team, the game has been showcased at various events, continually refining its gameplay and content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfaf How creatively can you solve puzzles with minimal moves?</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude80 Space Revolver</strong><br><strong>A Strategic Puzzle Adventure Utilizing Gravity and Map Rotation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Space Revolver</i> is a strategic puzzle game set aboard a space station. Players take on the role of a trainee who must solve increasingly complex puzzles using simple controls. By rotating the map and toggling gravity, players must navigate through challenging environments that test both creativity and logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd11</strong> <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Gravity Manipulation &amp; Map Rotation</strong>: Redefine spatial awareness by altering gravity and rotating the environment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/f50af957e282603af8be8387eb14e289.poster.avif?t=1755073869\" width=286 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/f50af957e282603af8be8387eb14e289.webm?t=1755073869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/f50af957e282603af8be8387eb14e289.mp4?t=1755073869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Evolving Puzzle Design</strong>: Start with intuitive challenges that gradually require logical deduction and strategic planning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Five Core Controls</strong>: Move left/right, rotate the map left/right, and toggle gravity on/off to find optimal solutions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Retro Pixel Art with Sci-Fi Aesthetics</strong>: Experience a unique visual style combining classic pixel art with futuristic effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Gameplay Overview</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic Controls</strong>: Left/Right Movement, Map Rotation (Left/Right), Gravity Toggle (On/Off)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Obstacles &amp; Mechanics</strong>: Lasers, spikes, electric blocks, switches, movable boxes, ON/OFF blocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playstyle</strong>: Limited moves encourage efficient problem-solving and multiple solution paths, embodying the &quot;Easy to Learn, Hard to Master&quot; philosophy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udccc Development Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originating from Krafton's Jungle Game Lab, <i>Space Revolver</i> evolved from a game jam concept into a commercial title through extensive feedback and iteration. Developed by a dedicated two-person team, the game has been showcased at various events, continually refining its gameplay and content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfaf How creatively can you solve puzzles with minimal moves?</strong></h2>",
    "short_description": "Space Revolver is a strategic puzzle game set in a space station. Use limited moves\u2014such as map rotation, gravity control, and horizontal movement\u2014to find the optimal path. Enjoy clever and deep puzzles with retro-style pixel art and a classic sci-fi atmosphere!",
